        },
        "text": "Too many people treat AI as a zero-sum race. Open-source is winning by doing the opposite: collaboration over competition! \n\nThis is why we’re excited to release today the first part of our partnership with @OpenRouter to make open models easier to use for all! Hugging Face for storage and collaboration. OpenRouter for inference. Connected so you can:\n\n🤗 Run OpenRouter inference directly on Hugging Face\n🔓 Access Open model weights directly from OpenRouter\n🤖 Store your OpenRouter agent traces on HF to inspect them, train better models or share them with the world!\n\nMore collaboration. Fewer zero-sum games. More power to AI builders. Let’s build! 💛💛💛"
      },
